{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（乙亥、前四六）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（乙亥、前四六）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab0d-db0e-11ef-9f09-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab11-db0e-11ef-9a0c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：辟，讀曰避；下同。欲屯田與之相守，以待其敝。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：辟，读曰避；下同。欲屯田与之相守，以待其敝。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"9156ab10-db0e-11ef-b504-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑氏","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"9156ab13-db0e-11ef-8ee3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"王制：冢宰制國用，視年之豐耗，祭用數之仂。鄭氏曰：算今年一歲經用之數，用其什一。夫以凶年之入，制經用之什一以供祭，則宗廟之禮宜有不備者矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"王制：冢宰制国用，视年之丰耗，祭用数之仂。郑氏曰：算今年一岁经用之数，用其什一。夫以凶年之入，制经用之什一以供祭，则宗庙之礼宜有不备者矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"9156ab12-db0e-11ef-97db-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"「嫌」，當讀作「慊」。慊之爲言厭也，意自足也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"「嫌」，当读作「慊」。慊之为言厌也，意自足也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"9156ab15-db0e-11ef-9e66-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab17-db0e-11ef-ba8b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：欲有來入內郡者，所至之處卽安置之。余謂便處者，各隨其所便而處之也。處，昌呂翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：欲有来入内郡者，所至之处即安置之。余谓便处者，各随其所便而处之也。处，昌吕翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":170,"tongjian_id":"9156ab16-db0e-11ef-b796-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"珠厓","place_name_jianti_auto":"珠厓","resolved_place_entity_id":2934,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9156ab19-db0e-11ef-b85d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","resolved_place_entity_id":134,"start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"9156ab1a-db0e-11ef-9a58-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"珠厓郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"珠厓郡","resolved_place_entity_id":2934,"start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"9156ab1b-db0e-11ef-a992-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉采众议","excerpts":[{"context_after":"匈奴呼韩邪单于既事汉，上书愿保塞上谷以西，请罢边备塞吏卒...","context_before":"汉元帝时，珠厓反，连年不定。","source_end_index":80,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9aa0a39c-54d6-48d0-846b-b42b34e36672","source_start_index":14,"source_text":"上与有司议大发军，待诏贾捐之建议，以为不当击。上以问丞相、御史，御史大夫陈万年以为当击，丞相于定国以为捐之议是，上从之，遂罢珠厓郡。"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/汉采众议","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["内政","外交"],"content":"1春，詔曰：「珠厓虜殺吏民，背畔爲逆。今廷議者或言可擊，或言可守，或欲棄之，其指各殊。朕日夜惟思議者之言，羞威不行，則欲誅之；狐疑辟難，則守屯田；通乎時變，則憂萬民。夫萬民之饑餓與遠蠻之不討，危孰大焉？且宗廟之祭，凶年不備，況乎辟不嫌之辱哉！今關東大困，倉庫空虛，無以相贍，又以動兵，非特勞民，凶年隨之。其罷珠厓郡，民有慕義欲內屬，便處之；不欲，勿強。」","content_fanyi":"春季，汉元帝下诏说：‘珠崖郡的叛虏杀害官吏和百姓，背叛朝廷造反。如今朝廷商议时，有的人主张可以出击，有的人主张坚守城堡，有的人主张放弃海岛，意见各不相同，各有理由。朕日夜思考大臣们的意见：耻于朝廷威信不能施行于海岛，便想发兵诛讨；迟疑不决、避难就易，便主张屯田驻守；能通达时势变化的，就会忧虑战争给千万百姓带来困苦。天下百姓的饥荒与不去讨伐远方蛮夷，哪一件事危害更大？况且宗庙祭祀在荒年尚且不能备齐祭品，哪里还顾得上边远地区那一点不值得在意的耻辱呢！如今关东百姓极为困苦，仓库空虚，没有能力相互救济；如果再兴兵动武，不只是使百姓劳苦、损耗财力，荒年还会随之而来。现在只能撤销珠崖郡，那里的民众有仰慕中原礼义、愿意内迁归附的，就妥善安置；不愿内迁的，不要勉强。’","content_jianti_auto":"1春，诏曰：「珠厓虏杀吏民，背畔为逆。今廷议者或言可击，或言可守，或欲弃之，其指各殊。朕日夜惟思议者之言，羞威不行，则欲诛之；狐疑辟难，则守屯田；通乎时变，则忧万民。夫万民之饥饿与远蛮之不讨，危孰大焉？且宗庙之祭，凶年不备，况乎辟不嫌之辱哉！今关东大困，仓库空虚，无以相赡，又以动兵，非特劳民，凶年随之。其罢珠厓郡，民有慕义欲内属，便处之；不欲，勿强。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2217,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab0e-db0e-11ef-97c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"茂陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"茂陵","resolved_place_entity_id":2179,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9156ab1d-db0e-11ef-b9ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白鶴館","place_name_jianti_auto":"白鹤馆","resolved_place_entity_id":8395,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9156ab1e-db0e-11ef-97ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2夏，四月，乙未晦，茂陵白鶴館災；赦天下。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月，乙未晦日，茂陵白鹤馆发生火灾；下诏大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，四月，乙未晦，茂陵白鹤馆灾；赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2218,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9156ab1c-db0e-11ef-8766-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3夏，旱。","content_fanyi":"夏季，发生旱灾。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，旱。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2219,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9156ab1f-db0e-11ef-ac09-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"旦","people_name_jianti_auto":"旦","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9156ab22-db0e-11ef-9019-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"定王","people_name_jianti_auto":"定王","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9156ab23-db0e-11ef-af50-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"發","people_name_jianti_auto":"发","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9156ab24-db0e-11ef-b67d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑氏","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9156ab25-db0e-11ef-bf13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長沙煬王","place_name_jianti_auto":"长沙炀王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab26-db0e-11ef-98e8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"長沙煬王旦，定王發之玄孫，初元元年薨，無後；今立其弟紹封。鄭氏曰：煬，音供養之養。諡法：好內遠禮曰煬；去禮遠衆曰煬。","note_content_jianti_auto":"长沙炀王旦，定王发之玄孙，初元元年薨，无后；今立其弟绍封。郑氏曰：炀，音供养之养。谥法：好内远礼曰炀；去礼远众曰炀。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9156ab21-db0e-11ef-af62-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"宗","people_xingming":"刘宗","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9156ab28-db0e-11ef-9bfb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9156ab20-db0e-11ef-b898-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yáng","source_anchor_text":"旱立長沙煬王弟宗為","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":4,"text":"煬","tongjian_id":"7917116f-f017-5350-8511-f24428ba5b9a"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長沙煬王","place_name_jianti_auto":"长沙炀王","resolved_place_entity_id":311,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9156ab29-db0e-11ef-9b7f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"4立長沙煬王弟宗爲王。","content_fanyi":"汉元帝册立已故长沙炀王刘旦的弟弟刘宗为长沙王。","content_jianti_auto":"4立长沙炀王弟宗为王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2220,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9156ab20-db0e-11ef-b898-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"烝，衆也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"烝，众也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"9156ab2c-db0e-11ef-8b4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab2f-db0e-11ef-b6f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：不急之事，故云非業也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：不急之事，故云非业也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"9156ab2e-db0e-11ef-8f07-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab31-db0e-11ef-8cf5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：費用之物務減省。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：费用之物务减省。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"9156ab30-db0e-11ef-82fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"宫廷事务","official_name":"長信少府","official_note":"長信少府是漢代官職，負責管理長信宮（太后居所）的事務，屬於宮廷內官。在《資治通鑑》此段中，貢禹擔任此職，上言建議減少離宮和長樂宮的衛士以減輕徭役，顯示其參與宮廷管理和政策建議的職能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"長信少府貢禹上言","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"2ebc7d72-6117-4f3b-826e-0915456315c0"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-124,"link_death_year":-44,"link_td_description":"贡禹，西汉中期大臣。字少翁，琅琊郡（今山东诸城）人。他在汉宣帝时，任谏大夫。他多次上书汉元帝，针对朝廷腐败、贵族奢侈、郡县人民贫困，建议皇帝选贤任能、诛杀奸臣，重视节俭、减轻徭役。初元五年（前44年）六月，代陈万年为御史大夫，十二月去世，薛广德继任。","link_td_id":"Q10013054","link_td_number_id":1551696,"people_name":"貢禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"贡禹","people_xingming":"贡禹","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9156ab32-db0e-11ef-a128-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長信","place_name_jianti_auto":"长信","resolved_place_entity_id":1961,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9156ab33-db0e-11ef-92de-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長樂宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"长乐宫","resolved_place_entity_id":797,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9156ab34-db0e-11ef-aa16-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"甘泉","place_name_jianti_auto":"甘泉","resolved_place_entity_id":648,"start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"9156ab35-db0e-11ef-8eed-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建章宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"建章宫","resolved_place_entity_id":2123,"start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"9156ab36-db0e-11ef-ac65-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5長信少府貢禹上言：「諸離宮及長樂宮衞，可減其太半以寬繇役。」六月，詔曰：「朕惟烝庶之饑寒，遠離父母妻子，勞於非業之作，衞於不居之宮，恐非所以佐陰陽之道也。其罷甘泉、建章宮衞，令就農。百官各省費。條奏，毋有所諱。」","content_fanyi":"长信少府贡禹上书说：“各离宫和长乐宫的卫士，可以裁减三分之二，以减轻百姓的徭役。”六月，汉元帝下诏说：“朕忧虑黎民百姓饥寒交迫，青壮之人远离父母、妻子儿女，从事非农业的劳作，守卫君王不去居住的宫殿，恐怕这不是用来调和阴阳的办法。应当撤销甘泉、建章两宫的卫士，让他们回家从事农耕。百官都要各自节省费用。凡有好的建议，分条上奏，不要有什么顾虑。”","content_jianti_auto":"5长信少府贡禹上言：「诸离宫及长乐宫衞，可减其太半以宽繇役。」六月，诏曰：「朕惟烝庶之饥寒，远离父母妻子，劳于非业之作，衞于不居之宫，恐非所以佐阴阳之道也。其罢甘泉、建章宫衞，令就农。百官各省费。条奏，毋有所讳。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2221,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9156ab2a-db0e-11ef-89c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"猛","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9156ab3a-db0e-11ef-a9e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張騫","people_name_jianti_auto":"张骞","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9156ab3b-db0e-11ef-9d19-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"猛，張騫孫也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"猛，张骞孙也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9156ab39-db0e-11ef-bd6a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"光祿勳","official_note":"光祿勳是漢代九卿之一，掌管宮廷宿衛和侍從，負責皇帝的安全和禮儀事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，周堪被提拔為光祿勳，顯示其受到皇帝的重用，職位重要。","official_rank":"九卿之一","source_snippet":"擢周堪爲光祿勳","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"4530836e-d719-465b-8a3a-1f5b5bf3fe0b"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"光祿大夫","official_note":"光祿大夫是漢代的榮譽官職，通常授予有學識或功績的官員，負責顧問和議論，無固定職掌。在《資治通鑑》此段中，張猛被任命為光祿大夫，表明其地位提升並受到信任。","official_rank":"中高級","source_snippet":"張猛爲光祿大夫","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"09686934-e4e1-4513-9c3d-39a287b2b3b2"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"給事中","official_note":"給事中是漢代的加官，允許官員在宮中侍從皇帝，參與機要事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，張猛兼任給事中，增強了其親近皇帝和處理政務的能力，反映其受信任程度。","official_rank":"中級","source_snippet":"給事中","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"e2c00ccd-a637-4ed5-bad4-ed0a393a3e88"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周堪","people_name_jianti_auto":"周堪","people_xingming":"周堪","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9156ab3c-db0e-11ef-8b1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"堪","people_name_jianti_auto":"堪","people_xingming":"周堪","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9156ab3d-db0e-11ef-83b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張猛","people_name_jianti_auto":"张猛","people_xingming":"张猛","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"9156ab3e-db0e-11ef-a98d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"6是歲，上復擢周堪爲光祿勳。堪弟子張猛爲光祿大夫、給事中，大見信任。","content_fanyi":"这一年，汉元帝再次起用周堪担任光禄勋。周堪的弟子张猛担任光禄大夫、给事中，深受信任。","content_jianti_auto":"6是岁，上复擢周堪为光禄勋。堪弟子张猛为光禄大夫、给事中，大见信任。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2222,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9156ab37-db0e-11ef-bce3-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"三年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"三年","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9156ab0c-db0e-11ef-8448-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（乙亥、前四六）","year_int":-46},"message":"success","success":true}